{"document":1,"title":"user in #6b7dfb22:9ee69ca6_3: I'm looking for some inspiration for new cocktails...","updated_at":"2023-05-21T09:04:00+00:00","source_type":"slack","content":"I'm looking for some inspiration for new cocktails to try at home. I've been experimenting with different flavors and ingredients lately, and I recently started a small herb garden on my balcony, which has been great for adding fresh herbs to my cocktails and dishes. Do you have any unique recipes that incorporate fresh herbs?","metadata":"{\"Channel\": \"6b7dfb22:9ee69ca6_3\"}"}
{"document":2,"title":"user in #6b7dfb22:377f8fd9_1: I've been thinking a lot about the concept of impe...","updated_at":"2023-05-27T17:09:00+00:00","source_type":"slack","content":"That makes a lot of sense. It's interesting that you mention the concept of detachment, because I've been thinking about that a lot lately. I've been trying to practice meditation daily, which has helped me feel more centered and calm, but I still find myself getting attached to certain outcomes or experiences. Do you have any advice on how to cultivate detachment in daily life, especially when it comes to things that are important to us, like relationships or personal goals?","metadata":"{\"Channel\": \"6b7dfb22:377f8fd9_1\"}"}
{"document":3,"title":"user in #6b7dfb22:574df152_1: I've been feeling really disconnected from my soci...","updated_at":"2023-05-20T06:14:00+00:00","source_type":"slack","content":"I've been feeling really disconnected from my social circle lately and I'm not sure how to get out of this rut. I've been trying to focus on solo activities like painting and video games, but it's not really fulfilling. By the way, speaking of solo activities, I had dinner by myself three times in one week two weeks ago, which is pretty unusual for me.","metadata":"{\"Channel\": \"6b7dfb22:574df152_1\"}"}
{"document":4,"title":"user in #6b7dfb22:answer_f6502d0f: I'm looking for some art supply recommendations. W...","updated_at":"2023-05-23T15:24:00+00:00","source_type":"slack","content":"I've been thinking about selling my paintings online and I was wondering if you could give me some tips on how to take good photos of my artwork. I've tried taking photos before, but they never seem to turn out right.","metadata":"{\"Channel\": \"6b7dfb22:answer_f6502d0f\"}"}
{"document":5,"title":"user in #6b7dfb22:603a8580_2: I'm planning a trip to Japan again and I want to s...","updated_at":"2023-05-24T21:01:00+00:00","source_type":"slack","content":"That's really helpful, thanks! I remember last time I was in Tokyo, I had a bit of trouble navigating the subway system, especially since I was exhausted from the flight and it was late at night when I arrived. I think I'll get a prepaid IC card to make travel easier. Can you tell me more about the Tsukiji Fish Market? I visited it last time and loved it, but I was wondering if there are any specific things I should try or avoid this time around.","metadata":"{\"Channel\": \"6b7dfb22:603a8580_2\"}"}
